OL,3,GNEWSADeal to sell Metrocentre for #516m
OL,4,Aagreed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deal to sell one of the country's
OL,7,Fbiggest shopping centres to a real
OL,8,Festate giant for #516m has been agreed.
OL,10,FLandsec said it would launch a #500m
OL,11,Fequity fundraiser to help fund a deal
OL,12,Fto buy the Metrocentre in Gateshead,
OL,13,Fwhich attracts more than 16 million
OL,14,Fvisitors each year, on Thursday.
OL,16,FLandsec, which is the majority owner of
OL,17,Fretail sites Bluewater in Kent and
OL,18,FLiverpool One, told shareholders it had
OL,19,Fexchanged contracts to buy 100% of the
OL,20,FMetrocentre from Tynehawk Holdings.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
