OL,3,GNEWSADeal to sell Metrocentre for #516m
OL,4,Aagreed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Allan, chief executive of the
OL,7,Ffirm, said the acquisition "represented
OL,8,Fa rare opportunity to obtain 100%
OL,9,Fcontrol of a top-10 UK shopping
OL,10,Fcentre".
